              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "We have received your order [239123**********] and have arranged for it to be delivered to your home. Please keep an eye on the order update! You've chosen \"Online Payment.\" The exact shipment information is provided in the paper shipping record for each package. When you have multiple orders to fulfill, the orders may be shipped in different packages. The information presented on the \"My Orders\" page determines your actual order information. You may also access the page at any moment to change the order."
              }
